msgid "skipped, %s"
msgstr "preskočeno, %s"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "XML"
msgstr "XML"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "YAML (default)"
msgstr "YAML (zadano)"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija SmokePinga"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Vaše ovlasti za uređaje ne obuhvaćaju sve uređaje pa ne možete izvesti ni uvesti konfiguraciju SmokePinga. Obratite se administratoru s pristupom svim uređajima."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Izvezi konfiguraciju SmokePinga"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Izvoz sadrži postavke dodatka, SmokePing ciljeve koje je dodatak očitao te podatke o tome kojem je uređaju svaki cilj pridružen prema nazivu računala i opisu uređaja. Ne sadrži izvore podataka, grafove, RRD datoteke ni vjerodajnice."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Preuzmi"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Uvezi konfiguraciju SmokePinga"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Odabirom datoteke provodi se samo njezina provjera. Na sljedećem zaslonu prikazan je popis svih promjena koje bi datoteka izvršila, a ništa se ne zapisuje dok ne potvrdite taj popis. Uvoz dodaje i ažurira zapise; nikada ne briše cilj niti premješta pridruživanje, i nikada ne stvara RRD datoteku niti dira mapu s podacima SmokePinga."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Provjeri datoteku"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Provjera uvoza"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Ništa nije zapisano."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Natrag"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Datoteku nije moguće uvesti dok se ove pogreške ne isprave. Ništa nije zapisano."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Instalacija već odgovara datoteci. Nema ničega za uvoz."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Plan %s. Primjenom se provode točno ove promjene u jednoj transakciji. Ako su se datoteka ili instalacija promijenile od ove provjere, uvoz će biti odbijen te trebate ponoviti provjeru."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Primijeni uvoz"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Odustani"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Dodaj ciljeve SmokePinga"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "nema odgovarajućeg cilja SmokePinga"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Kliknite Nastavi za dodavanje ciljeva SmokePinga čiji poslužitelj odgovara nazivu računala svakog odabranog uređaja. Svaki cilj dobiva sažeti graf za uzbunjivanje i, kada se podaci SmokePinga mogu prikazati grafom, smoke graf. Uređaji se ovdje nikada ne stvaraju."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "Broj podudarnih ciljeva: %d."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "Stvoreno ili pridruženo objekata: %d, preskočeno: %d."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Ovaj uređaj ima ciljeve SmokePinga, ali čitač koji popunjava njihove sažete vrijednosti radi na polleru %d, dok je uređaj spremljen na poller %d. Sažete vrijednosti i upozorenja prestaju stizati dok uređaj ponovno ne dodijelite polleru %d."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "Ciljevi SmokePinga za ovaj uređaj"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "Smoke grafovi koji još iscrtavaju drugu paletu boja (%d); glavni poller premješta do 200 po ciklusu."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "Nije bilo moguće premjestiti smoke grafove (%d); pokrenite naredbu upgrade-graphs za ponovni pokušaj te provjerite dnevnik sustava Cacti radi uzroka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Postavka Boje gubitaka traži boje gubitaka za SmokePing %s, no čitač je pronašao SmokePing %s. Postavite na Automatski osim ako grafovi trebaju odstupati od izvornih grafova SmokePinga."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Postavka Boje gubitaka odabire boje gubitaka inačice SmokePing %s za smoke grafove."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Čitač nije pronašao inačicu SmokePinga pa postavka Boje gubitaka odabire boje gubitaka za SmokePing 2.8 i novije. Ako koristite SmokePing 2.7, postavite Boje gubitaka na SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Čitač je pronašao SmokePing %s pa postavka Boje gubitaka odabire njegove boje gubitaka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "Thold nije instaliran pa nijedan cilj ne šalje upozorenja istodobno u SmokePingu i Tholdu."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Nijedan cilj nema istodobno upozorenje SmokePinga i omogućen prag u Tholdu."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "Ciljevi (%d) imaju i upozorenje SmokePinga i omogućen prag u Tholdu pa jedan problem može pokrenuti dvostruku obavijest. Usporedite njihove uvjete upozoravanja prije uklanjanja jednog od njih: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Uvoz predložaka SmokePinga nije uspio i ne ponavlja se automatski: %s Nakon otklanjanja uzroka upotrijebite Ponovi uvoz predložaka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "Predlošci SmokePinga nisu uvezeni. Upotrijebite Ponovi uvoz predložaka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php smokeping_health.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are imported."
msgstr "Predlošci SmokePinga su uvezeni."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Every device with summary data sources is polled by the reader's poller."
msgstr "Svaki uređaj sa sažetim izvorima podataka ispituje poller na kojem radi čitač."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d devices have summary data sources but are not polled by poller %d, which runs the reader, so their summary values and alerts have no data: %s"
msgstr "Uređaji (%d) imaju sažete izvore podataka, ali ih ne ispituje poller %d na kojem radi čitač, pa njihove sažete vrijednosti i upozorenja nemaju podatke: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration is read on poller %d, not on this server; the inventory row shows the result of its last read."
msgstr "Konfiguracija SmokePinga čita se na polleru %d, a ne na ovom poslužitelju; redak inventara prikazuje ishod njegova posljednjeg očitavanja."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "Konfiguraciju SmokePinga %s nije moguće očitati: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets; %d entries are skipped: %s"
msgstr "Konfiguracija SmokePinga %s navodi %d ciljeva; preskočeno je %d unosa: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets."
msgstr "Konfiguracija SmokePinga %s navodi %d ciljeva."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The PHP binary path setting is empty or not an executable file, so the reader cannot start."
msgstr "Postavka putanje do izvršne PHP datoteke je prazna ili nije izvršna datoteka pa se čitač ne može pokrenuti."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader starts with %s."
msgstr "Čitač se pokreće naredbom %s."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader has not completed a run on this poller."
msgstr "Čitač još nije dovršio nijedno pokretanje na ovom polleru."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last reader run finished %d seconds ago, more than three poller intervals."
msgstr "Posljednje pokretanje čitača završilo je prije %d s, što prelazi tri intervala pollera."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds and has exceeded its time budget %d times."
msgstr "Čitač je očitao %d od %d nizova za %.1f s i prekoračio vremenski okvir %d puta."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds, %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Čitač je očitao %d od %d nizova za %.1f s, prije %d s."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No inventory has been read on this poller."
msgstr "Na ovom polleru još nije očitan inventar."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last inventory failed %d seconds ago and the previous one is still in use: %s"
msgstr "Posljednje očitavanje inventara nije uspjelo prije %d s pa je prethodni još u uporabi: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The inventory listed %d targets %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Inventar je popisao %d ciljeva prije %d s."

#: lib/HealthPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "SmokePing Health for Poller %d"
msgstr "Ispravnost SmokePinga za poller %d"

